  "description": "The Piglet Hardtail Frame from Ragley is suited to rapid trail riding, technical terrains, fast descents and all-day epics. This frame is engineered using 4130 Chromoly (CrMo), has Boost hub spacing, a 44mm headtube and is compatible with modern components.The Piglet sounds like an underdog. It’s shorter travel than the Blue Pig and shares its geometry with the more trail-friendly Marley. But make no mistake, this Piglet is a special breed. The triple butted 4130 chromoly tubes supply the compliance for all day comfort but enough spring to make it a trail sniper’s dream on tight and twisty singletrack. Engaging, lively and accurate, the Piglet is a joy on all-day epics, smashing laps around the local woods or carving up the trail centres. The frame features all the modern standards, including ISCG 05 chain guide tabs and boost 148x12 axle spacing. This little piggy will make you go wee wee wee all the way home…",
